Package: oneconnect
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 openconnect,
 pkexec | polkitd,
 python3-aiohttp,
 python3-cryptography,
 python3-jwt
Description: Clavister NetWall OIDC + OpenConnect CLI helper
 OneConnect provides a CLI to authenticate through Clavister NetWall OIDC
 and launch OpenConnect with process control helpers.
 .
 This package installs the CLI command:
  - oneconnect

Package: oneconnect-gui
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1,
 gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
 python3-gi,
 oneconnect (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends:
 gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Description: Systray GUI for OneConnect (GTK3 + AppIndicator)
 OneConnect GUI provides a system-tray VPN launcher and profile manager
 for Clavister NetWall + OpenConnect workflows.
 .
 On GNOME desktops, AppIndicator support must be enabled for tray icons.
 The profile manager can always be opened with:
  oneconnect-gui --manage-profiles
